our devices.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> to see one. <b class="gd-ui">Turn off on this device</b> stops them there; <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes another device off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first: in Safari tap <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>. Open CarmaCars from your Home Screen, sign in and turn alerts on in Profile (iOS 16.4 or later).</p><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Alerts come as well as your emails and texts, never instead of them. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am. Sign-in links and codes never come as alerts.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-delete-my-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Delete my account</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b> and scroll to <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>, add a reason if you like, then <b class="gd-ui">Yes, delete my account</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">We settle anything still open (a rental, a deposit), delete your account and email you within 30 days. Changed your mind before then? Press <b class="gd-ui">Keep my account</b>.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>We keep rental agreements, receipts and tax records as the law requires. Everything else, including your licence and selfie photos, is deleted.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-odometer-and-fuel-at-pickup-and-return" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Odometer and fuel at pickup and return</h2><p class="gd-p">When you check the car in or out yourself:</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Add a photo of the dashboard (the odometer and the fuel gauge). It can come from your camera roll. We read it and ask, for example, &quot;Odometer 45,210 km, fuel 3/4: correct?&quot;. Press <b class="gd-ui">Yes, correct</b>, or <b class="gd-ui">No, I will type it</b> and type the odometer and pick the fuel level.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Take a selfie in front of the car with your camera.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">After the return, <b class="gd-ui">Your return: km and fuel</b> on your booking shows the km driven, the km included and any km over, the fuel compared with pickup, and the charge for each. The photo report shows both dashboard photos.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-earn-reward-points" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Earn reward points</h2><p class="gd-p">Review your rental (add a photo for extra points), review us on Google, follow us from your Rewards page, refer a friend, and every rental after your first earns points too. See them all on <b class="gd-ui">Rewards</b>.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-rewards-and-fuel-release-35" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Rewards and fuel (release 35)</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Earn points for a photo with your review and for every rental after your first; every way to earn is on your Rewards page.</li><li>A fuel shortfall at the return is priced from the car&#39;s tank and the local pump price, plus a refuelling fee, and checked by our team before any charge.</li></ul></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'bookings-and-your-own-use', 'chapter', 'home-and-your-vehicles', 'See every booking in your cars on a calendar, and book a car for yourself when it is free.

## See your bookings

1. Cars > Bookings shows two months of your cars on a calendar. Each block is a booking number.
2. All bookings lists every trip with its car, dates, amount and status.

![](/guides/img/owner-04-calendar-desktop-be31cbae.jpg "desktop; size: 980 1092; address: carmacars.ca/owner/bookings; pins: 1 53.1 15.8, 2 12.2 94.5")

> Good to know: A booking can show as Booked, with its dates and no amount: its amounts show once we approve the statement that covers it, and your statement always includes every booking. Unavailable is time your car is in use by us with no revenue for you (for example an insurance hold). A booking expense or a Revenue Share set for one booking is listed on that booking with the reason, and on your statement.

## Book your own car

You pay no rental charge, fee or deposit. A renter''s confirmed booking comes first.

1. Open Cars > Bookings and use **Book my own car** on the right (or **Book it for myself** on the car''s page).
2. Choose the Vehicle, then the Pickup and Return date and time.
3. Add a Note (optional) for our team.
4. Press **Book my car**. You sign the same agreement a renter signs.

![](/guides/img/owner-04-calendar-desktop-a4500851.jpg "desktop; size: 450 570; address: carmacars.ca/owner/bookings; pins: 2 92.2 14.6, 3 92.2 64.9, 4 42.2 89.6")

> Good to know: No price and no deposit apply to you. One booking can be 30 days at most, and you sign the rental agreement before pickup.
