or a commission.</li><li>Search traction: Google clicks and impressions of the last 28 days with their growth, the pages indexed and the weekly trend, from Search Console.</li><li>The search footprint: pages in 18 languages across place, car, model, event, airport, comparison and renting vs owning families.</li><li>The AI built into the work: automatic answers on every channel, calls recorded and transcribed, and an intent score on every lead.</li></ul></section>');
